---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import IsKarti from '../components/IsKarti.astro';
import KonseptNotu from '../components/KonseptNotu.astro';
import { site, whatsapp, paketler, surec, sorular } from '../data/site';
import { projeler } from '../data/projeler';
import { gorselNitelikleri } from '../lib/gorsel';

// Mirrors the visible FAQ below. Google and AI assistants quote from this.
const sssSema = {
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: sorular.map((s) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: s.soru,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: s.cevap },
  })),
};

/*
 * Four of the eight, chosen in projeler.ts rather than sliced here. The rest live
 * on /isler/. Eight full-width cards were 4,912px of a 13,755px phone page, which
 * is a third of the site spent on a grid nobody scrolls to the end of.
 */
const vitrinlik = projeler.filter((p) => p.oneCikan);

/*
 * The hero phones. Both are real Vitrin pages, captured by scripts/vitrin-telefon.mjs
 * and scrolled behind a mask by CSS. They are the two sectors the hero paragraph
 * names, in that order, so the picture and the sentence agree.
 *
 * Only the berber loads on phones. The lokanta strip is inside a <picture> whose
 * only <source> is gated at lg, so a phone never fetches it: a `hidden lg:block`
 * wrapper would still have cost the download.
 */
const telefonlar = [
  {
    slug: 'usta-nuri-berber',
    alt: 'Usta Nuri Erkek Kuaförü konsept sitesi bir telefon ekranında',
    gorsel: '/isler/usta-nuri-berber-telefon.webp',
  },
  {
    slug: 'bereket-lokantasi',
    alt: 'Bereket Lokantası konsept sitesi bir telefon ekranında',
    gorsel: '/isler/bereket-lokantasi-telefon.webp',
  },
];

const [berber, lokanta] = telefonlar;

const sorunlar = [
  {
    baslik: 'Instagram tek başına yetmiyor',
    metin:
      'Instagram takipçinizi elinizde tutuyor, ama arama yapan kişiye ulaşmıyor. Menüniz aranabilir değil, adresiniz haritaya düşmüyor. Hesabınız kapanırsa da her şey birlikte gidiyor.',
  },
  {
    baslik: 'Arama sonuçlarında yoksanız',
    metin:
      '“Yakınımdaki pide salonu” diye arayan kişi ilk üç sonuca bakıyor, dördüncüye pek inmiyor. O listede çıkmak şans işi değil, kurulum işi.',
  },
  {
    baslik: 'Karar birkaç saniyede veriliyor',
    metin:
      'Telefonda geç açılan ya da bozuk görünen bir sayfa, müşteriye işletme hakkında olmayan bir şey anlatıyor. Adil değil ama böyle oluyor.',
  },
];

/** How many bullets a package card shows before the rest fold into a <details>. */
const ACIK_MADDE = 4;
---

<Layout
  baslik="İstanbul Web Sitesi Yapımı"
  aciklama="İstanbul’daki lokanta, berber ve küçük işletmeler için hızlı, mobil uyumlu web siteleri kuruyoruz. Örnek tasarımı ücretsiz hazırlıyoruz, WhatsApp’tan yazın."
  semaEkleri={[sssSema]}
>
  {/* ---------- HERO ---------- */}
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div
      class="container-page grid items-center gap-5 py-10 md:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.85fr] lg:gap-16 lg:py-28"
    >
      {/*
        Order matters on phones. The heading comes first, then the proof, then the
        argument: a visitor who has seen a real page working on a real phone reads
        the paragraph differently. On lg the phones move to their own column and the
        text runs uninterrupted, so the order class only applies below it.
      */}
      <div class="contents lg:block">
        <h1 class="reveal order-1 text-[clamp(2.25rem,6vw,4.25rem)] font-bold">
          Müşteriniz sizi <span class="text-charcoal">arıyor.</span> Bulabiliyor mu?
        </h1>

        <p class="reveal order-3 max-w-xl text-lg text-charcoal/80 md:text-xl lg:mt-7">
          Bugün bir lokantayı ya da berberi merak eden kişi önce telefonunu açıyor.
          Karşısında bir site yoksa bir sonrakine geçiyor. Biz o siteyi kuruyoruz:
          hızlı açılan, telefonda düzgün görünen ve sizin adınıza olan bir site.
        </p>

        <div class="reveal order-4 mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 lg:mt-10">
          <a
            href={whatsapp()}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="inline-flex min-h-13 items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-navy px-7 py-3.5 font-display text-base font-semibold text-stone transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-navy-deep active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            WhatsApp’tan yazın
          </a>
          <a
            href="#isler"
            class="inline-flex min-h-13 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-navy/40 px-7 py-3.5 font-display text-base font-semibold text-navy transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-navy hover:bg-navy/5"
          >
            İşlerimize bakın
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="reveal order-7 text-sm text-charcoal/80 lg:order-5">
          İlk görüşme ve örnek tasarım ücretsiz. Beğenmediyseniz orada bırakırız.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/*
        The phones. Two on lg, overlapped so the pair reads as one object; one below
        it, because a second 480px-wide strip on a 390px screen is a download with
        nowhere to go.

        Order on phones is the whole argument of this hero, and it took three
        measurements to place. It began at order-2, directly under the h1, on the
        reasoning that proof should precede the argument: that put a 481px frame
        across 57% of a 390x844 screen and pushed the primary CTA to y=1061, 217px
        below the fold, so the first thing anyone read was the demo's own "bu bir
        örnek çalışmadır" bar in another brand's voice with nothing to act on.
        Moving it dead last fixed the CTA (y=514) but left only 32px of phone above
        the fold, which is not proof, just a sliver.

        So it sits between the CTA and the reassurance line: headline, promise,
        button, then roughly 250px of a real page visibly scrolling. The reassurance
        line goes below it on phones and back to its natural place from lg, where
        the phones occupy their own column and order stops applying.
      */}
      <div class="reveal order-6 mt-1 lg:relative lg:mt-0 lg:h-[34rem]">
        <div class="mx-auto w-[57vw] max-w-[15rem] sm:w-[42vw] lg:absolute lg:top-0 lg:right-0 lg:w-[17rem] lg:max-w-none lg:rotate-[3deg]">
          <div class="telefon">
            <img
              {...gorselNitelikleri(berber.gorsel)}
              alt={berber.alt}
              width="390"
              height="1600"
              loading="eager"
              fetchpriority="high"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 hidden w-[16rem] -rotate-[4deg] lg:block"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <div class="telefon" style="--sure: 34s">
            {/*
              The second phone is desktop-only, and "desktop-only" has to mean the
              bytes never leave the server: this strip is 98 KB and a phone has
              nowhere to put it. A hidden wrapper, display:none and loading="lazy"
              all still fetch in at least one engine, so the gate is a <picture>
              whose single <source> is media-gated at lg. Measured: desktop transfers
              98 KB for this element, a 390px phone transfers 0.

              The fallback is a 1x1 transparent GIF as a data URI rather than no src
              at all. An <img> without src is invalid HTML and the design detector
              flags it, correctly; a data URI keeps the element valid, costs no
              request, and is what a phone "loads" instead of the strip.
            */}
            <picture>
              <source
                media="(min-width: 1024px)"
                srcset={gorselNitelikleri(lokanta.gorsel).srcset}
                sizes="16rem"
              />
              <img
                src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7"
                alt=""
                width="390"
                height="1600"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </picture>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ---------- SORUN ---------- */}
  <section class="border-y border-charcoal/10 bg-stone-light/60">
    <div class="container-page py-12 md:py-24">
      <h2 class="reveal max-w-3xl text-[clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem)] font-bold">
        Google’da çıkmıyorsanız, o müşteri komşunuza gidiyor.
      </h2>

      <div class="reveal mt-10 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-charcoal/10 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {
          sorunlar.map((madde) => (
            <div class="bg-stone-light p-7 md:p-9">
              <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">{madde.baslik}</h3>
              <p class="mt-3.5 text-charcoal/80">{madde.metin}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ---------- İŞLER ---------- */}
  <section id="isler" aria-labelledby="isler-basligi" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="container-page py-12 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h2 id="isler-basligi" class="reveal baslik-buyuk font-bold">Anlatmak yerine yaptık.</h2>
        <p class="reveal mt-6 text-lg text-charcoal/80">
          {/*
            The space before <strong> is explicit. Astro strips a trailing newline
            between text and an inline tag, which rendered this live as
            "Hepsikonsept çalışma", in the one sentence carrying the konsept
            disclosure. Do not reflow this line without keeping {' '}.
          */}
          Aşağıdaki siteleri, işletmeler bizden istemeden önce hazırladık. Hepsi{' '}
          <strong class="font-semibold text-navy">konsept çalışma</strong>, hepsi gerçekten
          yayında. Açın, telefonunuzda gezin, ne kadar hızlı açıldığına bakın.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-7 lg:gap-8" role="list">
        {vitrinlik.map((proje) => <IsKarti proje={proje} />)}
      </ul>

      <a
        href="/isler/"
        class="baglanti-alti reveal mt-10 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 font-display text-base font-semibold text-navy"
      >
        Sekiz çalışmanın tamamı
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
          class="h-4 w-4"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M4 10h11M11 5.5 15.5 10 11 14.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
      </a>

      <KonseptNotu projeler={vitrinlik} class="reveal mt-8" />
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ---------- HİZMETLER ---------- */}
  <section id="hizmetler" aria-labelledby="hizmetler-basligi" class="scroll-mt-24 border-y border-charcoal/10 bg-stone-light/60">
    <div class="container-page py-12 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h2 id="hizmetler-basligi" class="reveal text-[clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem)] font-bold">
          Bütçenize göre bir başlangıç var.
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal mt-6 text-lg text-charcoal/80">
          En küçük paketimiz küçük bir kurulum ücretiyle başlıyor, sonrasında aylık ya
          da yıllık ödeme istemiyoruz. Siteniz bizim adresimiz altında yayına giriyor,
          işe yaradığını gördüğünüzde kendi alan adınıza geçiyorsunuz.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal mt-10 grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {
          paketler.map((paket) => {
            const acik = paket.kapsam.slice(0, ACIK_MADDE);
            const kalan = paket.kapsam.slice(ACIK_MADDE);
            const ikon = paket.oneCikan ? 'text-stone/80' : 'text-navy';
            const govde = paket.oneCikan ? 'text-stone/90' : 'text-charcoal/80';

            return (
              <div
                class={`flex flex-col rounded-2xl border p-6 md:p-9 ${
                  paket.oneCikan
                    ? 'border-navy bg-navy text-stone shadow-[0_20px_50px_-30px_rgba(46,59,105,0.7)]'
                    : 'border-charcoal/12 bg-stone-light'
                }`}
              >
                {paket.oneCikan && (
                  <span class="mb-5 self-start rounded-full bg-stone/20 px-3 py-1 font-display text-[0.68rem] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">
                    En çok tercih edilen
                  </span>
                )}

                <h3 class={`font-display text-2xl font-bold ${paket.oneCikan ? 'text-stone' : ''}`}>
                  {paket.ad}
                </h3>
                <p
                  class={`mt-1.5 font-display text-sm font-semibold ${paket.oneCikan ? 'text-stone/75' : 'text-charcoal/80'}`}
                >
                  {paket.vurgu}
                </p>

                <p class={`mt-5 ${paket.oneCikan ? 'text-stone/90' : 'text-charcoal/80'}`}>
                  {paket.aciklama}
                </p>

                <ul class="mt-7 space-y-3" role="list">
                  {acik.map((madde) => (
                    <li class="flex gap-3">
                      <svg
                        viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                        class={`mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 ${ikon}`}
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2.25"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                      >
                        <path d="m4.5 10.5 3.5 3.5 7.5-8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                      </svg>
                      <span class={`text-sm ${govde}`}>{madde}</span>
                    </li>
                  ))}
                </ul>

                {/*
                  The rest fold away. Three tiers of eight bullets each was 2,722px on
                  a phone, which made the one thing these cards exist for, comparing
                  them, impossible: you could never hold two on screen at once.
                  <details> keeps that zero-JS, the same way the FAQ does.
                */}
                {kalan.length > 0 && (
                  <details class="group mt-4">
                    <summary
                      class={`inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-1.5 font-display text-sm font-semibold ${
                        paket.oneCikan ? 'text-stone/90' : 'text-navy'
                      }`}
                    >
                      <span class="group-open:hidden">{kalan.length} madde daha</span>
                      <span class="hidden group-open:inline">Kısalt</span>
                      <svg
                        viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                        class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                      >
                        <path d="m5 8 5 5 5-5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                      </svg>
                    </summary>
                    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3" role="list">
                      {kalan.map((madde) => (
                        <li class="flex gap-3">
                          <svg
                            viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                            class={`mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 ${ikon}`}
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2.25"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                          >
                            <path d="m4.5 10.5 3.5 3.5 7.5-8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                          </svg>
                          <span class={`text-sm ${govde}`}>{madde}</span>
                        </li>
                      ))}
                    </ul>
                  </details>
                )}

                <p
                  class={`mt-7 font-display text-sm font-semibold ${paket.oneCikan ? 'text-stone/75' : 'text-charcoal/80'}`}
                >
                  {paket.fiyatNotu}
                </p>

                <a
                  href={whatsapp(paket.cta)}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                  class={`mt-4 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full px-6 py-3 font-display text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-200 active:scale-[0.98] ${
                    paket.oneCikan
                      ? 'bg-stone text-navy hover:bg-white'
                      : 'bg-navy text-stone hover:bg-navy-deep'
                  }`}
                >
                  {paket.ctaEtiket}
                </a>
              </div>
            );
          })
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ---------- SÜREÇ ---------- */}
  <section id="surec" aria-labelledby="surec-basligi" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="container-page py-12 md:py-24">
      <h2 id="surec-basligi" class="reveal max-w-3xl text-[clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem)] font-bold">
        Dört adımda ilerliyoruz.
      </h2>

      <ol class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-7 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4" role="list">
        {
          surec.map((adim) => (
            <li class="border-t-2 border-navy/25 pt-5">
              {/*
                Full navy at label size, not a 30px ghost at navy/25. The number is
                the only thing telling the reader these four are a sequence rather
                than a list, and it was measuring 1.52:1.
              */}
              <span class="font-display text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-navy">
                {adim.adim}
              </span>
              <h3 class="mt-2.5 font-display text-lg font-semibold">{adim.baslik}</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-charcoal/80">{adim.metin}</p>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ---------- SIK SORULANLAR ---------- */}
  <section id="sorular" aria-labelledby="sorular-basligi" class="scroll-mt-24 border-y border-charcoal/10 bg-stone-light/60">
    <div class="container-page py-12 md:py-24">
      <h2 id="sorular-basligi" class="reveal max-w-3xl text-[clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem)] font-bold">
        WhatsApp’ta en çok bunlar soruluyor.
      </h2>

      <div class="reveal mt-10 grid max-w-4xl gap-4">
        {
          sorular.map((s) => (
            <details class="group rounded-xl border border-charcoal/12 bg-stone-light px-6 py-3 open:bg-stone">
              <summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-2 font-display text-base font-semibold text-navy">
                {s.soru}
                <svg
                  viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                  class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                >
                  <path d="M10 4.5v11M4.5 10h11" stroke-linecap="round" />
                </svg>
              </summary>
              <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl pb-3 text-charcoal/80">{s.cevap}</p>
            </details>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* ---------- HAKKIMIZDA + CTA ---------- */}
  <section id="iletisim" aria-labelledby="iletisim-basligi" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-navy text-stone">
    <div class="container-page grid gap-10 py-12 md:py-24 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
      <div>
        <h2 id="iletisim-basligi" class="reveal text-[clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem)] font-bold !text-stone">
          İki kişilik bir ekibiz.
        </h2>
        <div class="reveal mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg text-stone/75">
          <p>
            Mevcut Digital iki ortaktan oluşuyor. Biri işi konuşuyor, diğeri kodu yazıyor.
            Aradığınızda çağrı merkezine değil, siteyi yapan kişiye ulaşıyorsunuz.
          </p>
          <p>
            İstanbul’daki lokantalar ve mahalle esnafıyla çalışıyoruz. Küçük işletmenin nasıl
            döndüğünü biliyoruz: vaktiniz kısıtlı ve teknik terimlerle uğraşmak istemiyorsunuz.
            Biz de sizi teknik terimlerle yormuyoruz.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal rounded-2xl bg-stone/8 p-6 md:p-10">
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold !text-stone">Bir mesaj yeterli</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-stone/75">
          İşletmenizi anlatın, size ne yapabileceğimizi ücretsiz gösterelim.
        </p>

        <a
          href={whatsapp()}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="mt-7 inline-flex min-h-13 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-stone px-7 py-3.5 font-display text-base font-semibold text-navy transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-white active:scale-[0.98]"
        >
          Hemen mesaj gönderin
        </a>

        <dl class="mt-8 space-y-2 border-t border-stone/20 pt-6 text-sm">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <dt class="text-stone/75">Telefon</dt>
            <dd>
              <a
                href={site.telefonHref}
                class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-semibold underline decoration-stone/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-stone"
              >
                {site.telefon}
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <dt class="text-stone/75">E-posta</dt>
            <dd>
              <a
                href={`mailto:${site.eposta}`}
                class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-semibold underline decoration-stone/40 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-stone"
              >
                {site.eposta}
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
